+| destination kind | packets | the first packet's addr | step per packet |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 0 big SRAM | mode 9 (4.9) | chunk address = tile address × 32 | +4 chunks |
+| 1 controller memory | mode 5 (4.11) | packed word = tile address × 32 | +4 words |
+| 2 the replayer | mode 8 (4.17) | replayer word address = tile address × 32 | +4 words |
